title: "ankara-ponds-edna"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the data: Cuenca-Cambronero et al. 2026, Nature Ecology & Evolution, doi:10.1038/s41559-026-03197-w (reads ENA PRJNA1495761)."
type: software
abstract: "Prototype: LifeWatch ERIC's metabarcoding pipeline PEMA v3.0.0 (12S) on the public PONDERFUL eDNA reads of 29 ponds west of Ankara, Türkiye, with an NCBI BLAST check and a per-pond summary."
